# 1node_8gpu -- no-op marker overlay. Every 4B paper arm already runs on one node with 8 x 80 GB GPUs
# (the recipes' default), so this overlay sets nothing; it exists so that "the paper hardware" can be
# named explicitly (`--overlay 1node_8gpu`) and recorded in the run's provenance. The 30B arms need two
# such nodes (see scripts/common/ray_cluster.sh) and are not changed by this overlay either.
